Z||000007||Carrolles||07-31-2001||01:22 PM||||Spray on oven cleaner works well on carbon.  Spray it on, let it sit then hose it off.||||reg||1
Z||000008||gt boy||07-31-2001||10:19 PM||||i found that the GM product called "kleens" worked wonders on all my vehicles. always had a little more snap when i was finished.||||reg||1
Z||000009||grinthock||07-31-2001||11:38 PM||||Canadian Tire brand Carb clean -- Don't buy the Throttle Body cleaner it's the same stuff at half the power... Just used it last weekned to clean my IAC.||||reg||1
